[{"client_msg_id":"b40d3c3f-3ce7-44fe-9bd4-85ac944829f7","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"一応suspendできるらしいけど、その状態でもいろいろやることはありそうだ...","ts":"1635467706.010600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UGO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"933c5bb3-365b-4c74-b269-cde0886b6425","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/changes-your-business/temporarily-stop.html\u003e","ts":"1635467673.010000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Temporarily stopping business operations - Canada.ca","id":1,"title":"Temporarily stopping business operations - Canada.ca","title_link":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/changes-your-business/temporarily-stop.html","text":"Suspend operations","blocks":null,"service_name":"canada.ca","service_icon":"https://www.canada.ca/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/changes-your-business/temporarily-stop.html","original_url":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/changes-your-business/temporarily-stop.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DdKEj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98943386-f5d5-4746-ae06-6972d4a4ccec","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なるほど休眠、調べてみよう、本当にほしいのはそっちです","ts":"1635467639.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nAu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86d7d2cc-b08d-45ae-9bbc-2f093dc19b52","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"いまのところ知っている維持に必要なコスト\n• 毎月のnil remittance (作業のみ)\n• 毎年のcorporate annual report ($12)\n• 納税関係 (accountant + 他たぶんなにか)","ts":"1635467621.009200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ty0fP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9C17886A-3004-4B95-9830-68A63A9E6CA0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本だと、公告とか面倒","ts":"1635467002.007900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qgoc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cfc01b5-20e4-4c31-b5f8-9d9d3d02dff0","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"日本だと、休眠という制度もあるけど。","ts":"1635466944.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FSEhY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06c50d9c-b548-4343-90e8-946cd14460ff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"カナダはわからないけど、日本で法人があることの対外的なメリットって大きいので、多少負担があっても維持しとくの、とても便利という教えがある。","ts":"1635464579.006000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1635464590.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a452a71f-7243-4dc5-8a01-5667b8c5ce5c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なにもしない会社の維持コストも調べとくとよさげ。","ts":"1635464532.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Nw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee159cc0-8b60-493a-a1bf-95ca9753664e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(TOSIについていまだにきちんと理解しきれていないので結局ここも調査しないといけない...)","ts":"1635464203.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc37c247-993c-4d6d-987a-54839f284de1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"たぶんいったん会社側での仕事の請取をやめて、会社の資産をじわじわとdividendsで自分に放流する、だけど、この場合TOSIにより税率が33%になってしまいそう (small business corporate income tax rateが15%なので、あわせて43%)","ts":"1635464113.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v2i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0af1503-5fb1-4bc2-838c-805398f1b869","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://www.ic.gc.ca/eic/site/cd-dgc.nsf/eng/cs07074.html\u003e","ts":"1635463982.002400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Guide on dissolving a business corporation - Corporations Canada","id":1,"title":"Guide on dissolving a business corporation - Corporations Canada","title_link":"https://www.ic.gc.ca/eic/site/cd-dgc.nsf/eng/cs07074.html","text":"Guide on dissolving a business corporation","blocks":null,"service_name":"ic.gc.ca","service_icon":"https://www.ic.gc.ca/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.ic.gc.ca/eic/site/cd-dgc.nsf/eng/cs07074.html","original_url":"https://www.ic.gc.ca/eic/site/cd-dgc.nsf/eng/cs07074.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d49cv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a87d61d-ca1d-421a-8990-db2202d8a1d9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"closingもclosingでかなり大変そうなんだよなあ... 厳しい","ts":"1635463966.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NjkpA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65f42f0c-d039-4e42-89ed-27d696b138cb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"納税のための作業 (というか調査と勉強) があまりに大変かつstressfulなので、会社のclosingの方法についても調べ始めることにしました","ts":"1635463939.001900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y5p5"}]}]
